                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "padding"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", etc., require their values be a measurement. If you specify a number without any units, the units defaults to points (pt), the unit of measure for the PDF canvas. A point is defined as 1/72 of an inch."
              }
